{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"維港泳大會宣布取消優悠組最後一組賽事\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-15-11-13-01NdGcWZnC.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】維港泳大會宣布，因水流急及安全問題，取消優悠組最後一組賽事，最後一組賽事當時有約700名泳手仍未落水。</p><p>賽事在早上約9時42分突然宣布取消，已下水的參賽者需要上岸離開，岸邊亦有大批泳手正在等候下水，現場宣布已安排接駁巴士接送參賽者離開。</p><p>優悠組最後一組有約700人參賽，原定在9時出發。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T03:55:03.140213+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T03:11:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T14:56:12.970120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T03:48:35.482817+00:00","content_hash":"ee325b328119d8853e128fa5139714de52d980f6293eae714eb0532e8385f7cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T03:55:03.140213+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}